      "statement": "Plugins are external systems (ADR-0012): extraction plugins are called by the extraction-agent via the A2A skill sandman.plugin.extract, detector plugins by the inconsistency-agent via plain HTTP POST /v1/detect; both transports are in the contract with identical payloads, but each owner implements only one in M0 (D-7).",
