      "id": "claim_44517f0b1a934835a7cb9077863db9c8",
      "statement": "Every plugin has a token pair generated by deploy/gen-secrets.sh: the inbound token plugin_in_<id> (SANDMAN_PLUGIN_INBOUND_TOKEN_FILE) which the plugin checks via constant-time Bearer comparison on every call except /healthz and the Agent Card, and the outbound token svc_token_<id> (SANDMAN_SERVICE_TOKEN_FILE) making the caller plugin:<id>, restricted to read-only project-anchored POST /v1/query/cypher for projects granted in config/query/plugins.yaml; owners never send their own service token to plugins.",
